 src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-find-signs-of-extreme-aging-and-youth-in-the-same-117-year-old.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 01:18:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-find-signs-of-extreme-aging-and-youth-in-the-same-117-year-old</guid></item><item><title>为什么工业边缘处理器供应承诺比高通的规格更重要</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-the-industrial-edge-processor-supply-commitment-matters-more-than-qualcomms-specs</link><description>Qualcomm 的 IQ-2390 设定了到 2036 年的工业边缘处理器供应承诺，大大降低了买家的生命周期中期重新设计风险。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-the-industrial-edge-processor-supply-commitment-matters-more-than-qualcomms-specs.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 01:03:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-the-industrial-edge-processor-supply-commitment-matters-more-than-qualcomms-specs</guid></item><item><title>物理学家将经典光转变为用于信息处理的量子机器</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/physicists-turn-classical-light-into-a-quantum-machine-for-information-processing</link><description>量子计算机有望解决当今计算机极其困难的问题。但有一个主要障碍：量子系统是出了名的脆弱。噪音、损失甚至微小的干扰都会破坏赋予它们力量的微妙行为。构建具有许多量子粒子的系统也极具挑战性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/physicists-turn-classical-light-into-a-quantum-machine-for-information-processing2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 00:48:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/physicists-turn-classical-light-into-a-quantum-machine-for-information-processing</guid></item><item><title>Maven Robotics 斥资 1 亿美元开发仓库机器人</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/maven-robotics-exits-stealth-with-100m-for-warehouse-bots</link><description>Maven Robotics 以 1 亿美元的 A 轮融资退出了隐秘行列。8 轮双臂机器人已经为财富 250 强客户进行 16 小时轮班运行。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/maven-robotics-exits-stealth-with-100m-for-warehouse-bots.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:33:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/maven-robotics-exits-stealth-with-100m-for-warehouse-bots</guid></item><item><title>朱莉娅·兰伯特 (Julia Lampert) 谈 2035 年之前成为人工智能原生者</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/julia-lampert-on-becoming-ai-native-before-2035</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/julia-lampert-on-becoming-ai-native-before-2035.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:18:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/julia-lampert-on-becoming-ai-native-before-2035</guid></item><item><title>Helium-3 以更快的隧道速率提升新的量子计算概念</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/helium-3-lifts-new-quantum-computing-concept-with-faster-tunneling-rates</link><description>氦是最轻的原子，可以通过激光冷却和控制，为高性能、稳定的量子计算机的新设计提供动力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/helium-3-lifts-new-quantum-computing-concept-with-faster-tunneling-rates2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:03:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/helium-3-lifts-new-quantum-computing-concept-with-faster-tunneling-rates</guid></item><item><title>一种 RNA 核苷酸开关如何激活荧光染料</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-one-rna-nucleotide-switch-activates-fluorescent-dyes</link><description>RhoBAST 是一种微小的 RNA 分子，可以激活荧光染料，使研究人员能够以超分辨率追踪活细胞中的 RNA 分子。有机化学研究所的 Ronald Micura 和他的团队参与的一项国际合作现已表明，RNA 内的一个小型局部“核苷酸翻转”控制着这种荧光激活。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-one-rna-nucleotide-switch-activates-fluorescent-dyes2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:48:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-one-rna-nucleotide-switch-activates-fluorescent-dyes</guid></item><item><title>单一纳米结构能够独立控制两种光共振模式</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/single-nanostructure-enables-independent-control-of-two-light-resonance-modes</link><description>金属纳米结构在将光集中到微小体积方面非常有效，而介电纳米结构则擅长以最小的能量损失存储光。传统上，结合这些互补特性需要复杂的混合结构，其中两种光学模式混合，使得它们难以独立控制。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/single-nanostructure-enables-independent-control-of-two-light-resonance-modes2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:33:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/single-nanostructure-enables-independent-control-of-two-light-resonance-modes</guid></item></channel></rss>